ntent\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Hoc-bong-toan-phan-hoc-sinh-Tsubusa-370x426.jpg 370w, https:\/\/duhocxkld-tsubasa.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Hoc-bong-toan-phan-hoc-sinh-Tsubusa-410x473.jpg 410w, https:\/\/duhocxkld-tsubasa.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Hoc-bong-toan-phan-hoc-sinh-Tsubusa.jpg 780w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dafac95 elementor-widget__width-initial sc_fly_static elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"dafac95\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\u00a0<\/p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">\u0110I\u1ec0U KI\u1ec6N \u1ee8NG TUY\u1ec2N:<\/span><\/strong><\/p><ul><li>N\u1eef tu\u1ed5i 18 ~ 25 t\u1ed1t nghi\u1ec7p THPT tr\u1edf l\u00ean, \u01b0u ti\u00ean t\u1ed1t nghi\u1ec7p C\u0110, \u0110H chuy\u00ean ng\u00e0nh h\u1ed9 l\u00fd, \u0111i\u1ec1u d\u01b0\u1ee1ng<\/li><li>S\u1ee9c kh\u1ecfe t\u1ed1t, Y\u00eau th\u00edch c\u00f4ng vi\u1ec7c ch\u0103m s\u00f3c ng\u01b0\u1eddi gi\u00e0<\/li><li>Cam k\u1ebft sau khi h\u1ecdc xong chuy\u00ean ng\u00e0nh ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0m cho Vi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi th\u1eddi gian 5 n\u0103m<\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>QUY\u1ec0N L\u1ee2I:<\/strong><\/span><\/p><ul><li>\u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00e0i tr\u1ee3 100% ti\u1ec1n h\u1ecdc trong su\u1ed1t 3 n\u0103m ( 1 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1eddng ti\u1ebfng Nh\u1eadt, 2 n\u0103m h\u1ecdc chuy\u00ean ng\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec1u d\u01b0\u1ee1ng) tr\u1ecb gi\u00e1 ~ <strong>600 tri\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ed3ng.<\/strong><\/li><li>V\u1eeba h\u1ecdc v\u1eeba l\u00e0m t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7n d\u01b0\u1ee1ng l\u00e3o v\u1edbi m\u1ee9c thu nh\u1eadp cao l\u00ean t\u1edbi 30 tri\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ed3ng\/ th\u00e1ng.<\/li><li>Chi ph\u00ed xu\u1ea5t c\u1ea3nh c\u1ef1c th\u1ea5p<\/li><li>Sau khi h\u1ecdc xong chuy\u00ean ng\u00e0nh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c l\u00e2u d\u00e0i v\u1edbi m\u1ee9c thu nh\u1eadp cao \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh l\u00ean t\u1edbi 50 tri\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ed3ng\/ th\u00e1ng.<\/li><li>H\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u1ecdc b\u1ed5ng, h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed3ng lao \u0111\u1ed9ng r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng, minh b\u1ea1ch tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi bay.<\/li><\/ul><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>LI\u00caN H\u1ec6 T\u01af V\u1ea4N MI\u1ec4N PH\u00cd: 0968.668.363<\/strong><\/span><\/div><div>\u00a0<\/div><div>\u00a0<\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-ba970c1 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default sc_fly_static\" data-id=\"ba970c1\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0b7b3b2 sc_content_align_inherit sc_layouts_column_icons_position_left sc_fly_static\" data-id=\"0b7b3b2\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>\u00a0 \u0110I\u1ec0U KI\u1ec6N \u1ee8NG TUY\u1ec2N: N\u1eef tu\u1ed5i 18 ~ 25 t\u1ed1t nghi\u1ec7p THPT tr\u1edf l\u00ean, \u01b0u ti\u00ean t\u1ed1t nghi\u1ec7p C\u0110, \u0110H chuy\u00ean ng\u00e0nh h\u1ed9 l\u00fd, \u0111i\u1ec1u d\u01b0\u1ee1ng S\u1ee9c kh\u1ecfe t\u1ed1t,&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-2737","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/duhocxkld-tsubasa.com\